[20.384033, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[21.052042, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mhelm preflight upgrade --help 2>&1\r\nRenders both the from (baseline) and to (candidate) charts offline,\r\ndiffs the manifests, evaluates Rego/Kyverno security policies, and emits a JSON report.\r\n\r\nNo cluster access, no network calls, and no deployment occur.\r\n\r\nExit codes:\r\n  0  PASS           - all configured offline checks passed\r\n  2  BLOCK          - at least one enforced policy was violated\r\n  3  INDETERMINATE  - required verification could not be completed\r\n  4  error          - tool execution failure\r\n\r\nEvaluators:\r\n  conftest  (default) Uses Conftest + Rego policies (OPA). Requires conftest in PATH.\r\n  kyverno             Phase 1 roadmap — not yet implemented.\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  preflight upgrade [flags]\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n      --evaluator string      Security evaluator: conftest (default) or kyverno (Phase 1) (default \"conftest\")\r\n      --from string           Path to baseline chart directory or tarball (required)\r\n  -h, --help                  help for upgrade\r\n      --kube-version string   Kubernetes version for Capabilities (required, e.g. 1.28)\r\n      --namespace string      Kubernetes namespace (default \"default\")\r\n      --output-file string    Write JSON report to file (default: stdout)\r\n      --policy-dir string     Directory containing Rego policies (default: $HELM_PLUGIN_DIR/policies/rego)\r\n      --release-name string   Helm release name (required)\r\n      --to string             Path to candidate chart directory or tarball (required)\r\n      --values string         Path to values file (optional)\r\n"]
[22.165503, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[22.724291, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mwhich conftest 2>&1 && conftest --version 2>&1\r\n/home/vpcuser/bin/conftest\r\nConftest: 0.71.1\r\nOPA: 1.21.1\r\n"]
[23.895356, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
